# Q7 What data products does process P produce or consume? (value-stream processes, with the process-map processes they realize, and the process-map processes a decision links directly)
PREFIX vs: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/value-stream/>
PREFIX dp: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/data-product/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?step ?process ?relation ?item WHERE {
  {
    VALUES ?relation { vs:produces vs:consumes }
    ?step ?relation ?item .
    OPTIONAL { ?step vs:realizes ?process }
  } UNION {
    VALUES (?direct ?relation) { (dp:producedBy vs:produces) (dp:consumedBy vs:consumes) }
    ?item ?direct ?process .
  }
}
